    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1、作業及報告20% 2、課堂表現及出缺席40% 3、期中考期末考40%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>期中考與期末考在合理的請假理由之下，得以透過其他形式完成考試。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>1. Assignments and reports 20% 2. Class performance and absences 40% 3. Midterm exam and final exam 40%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Midterm and final exams can be completed in other ways with reasonable excuses for leave.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "一、多元化和包容性\n所有課程活動都將在同學之間的友好參與和互動氛圍中進行，彼此間尊重和欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點，如國內外各學制、多元入學及學習文化、性別等。希望您始終在本課程中應用最高的學術標準，並以有尊嚴和尊重的態度對待同學。 \n二、課堂行為\n課堂上的行為始終應要及時、要專業、要做好準備、要有禮貌。同學、教師或其他講師間，應保有彼此尊嚴和相互尊重，才能進行有效的學習。為了確保有利於學習環境，冀望每個人都能做到以下幾點，彼此遵守課堂行為規則，習慣禮貌的文化。\n1. 禁止上課睡覺\n2. 禁止上課使用手機進行與課堂無關的事情\n3. 不得戴耳機上課",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Diversity and Inclusion\nAll course activities will be conducted in an atmosphere of friendly participation and interaction among classmates, with mutual respect and appreciation for each student's personal experience, background and perspective, such as various academic systems at home and abroad, diverse admissions and learning cultures, gender, etc. You are expected to always apply the highest academic standards in this course and treat your classmates with dignity and respect.\n2. Classroom Behavior\nBehavior in the classroom should always be prompt, professional, prepared, and courteous. Students, teachers or other lecturers should maintain dignity and respect for each other in order to have effective learning. To ensure a conducive learning environment, everyone is expected to do the following, abide by the rules of classroom conduct and develop a culture of courtesy.\n1. Sleeping in class is prohibited\n2. It is prohibited to use mobile phones during class for things unrelated to class.\n3. You are not allowed to wear headphones in class",
    "course_rem": "希望各位同學能按授課進度完成各項學習任務，有規矩地、主動積極地參與各項學習活動，完成各項學習任務，並符合本課程的學習目標者，以獲得應得的成績。",
    "course_rem_en": "I hope that all students can complete various learning tasks according to the teaching schedule, participate in various learning activities in a disciplined and proactive manner, complete various learning tasks, and meet the learning goals of this course to obtain the grades they deserve.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Learning must be based on integrity. Any student who attempts to pass off work that he has not produced as his own is considered dishonest. Students who cheat or plagiarize in assignments, tests or exams, or assist others, will be graded as zero points. If they are repeat offenders, they will be punished in accordance with university&#39;s student rewards and punishment regulations.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
